TITLE 1D transport: Ca-Cl initial, Na-Cl inflow, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivity 0
    -correct_disp true
    -print_frequency 10
    -punch_frequency 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step logIAP_H2_ex3
10 PUNCH TOTAL_TIME, SI("H2(g)")

END
